                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "i am not following why we have inconsistent type declarations here for `loggingPath`, can it also be `static constexpr auto` ?\n\nSince these are used as `sdbusplus::object_path` anyways from line 144 onwards, does it make sense to directly use that type instead."
